Package: tlt_custom_pkg_yachtsense-link-emulator
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Architecture: arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4
Router: RUTX
tlt_name: yachtsense-link-emulator
@FIRMWARE_FIELD@
Maintainer: Roel Broersma
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc, api-core, vuci-ui-core
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: YachtSense Link emulator and Raymarine app discovery relay for Teltonika RUTX routers on RutOS 7. Includes ARMv7 mDNS/DNS-SD and HTTP services, selective cross-interface Raymarine discovery reflection, Avahi/UDP-5353 diagnostics, UCI/procd integration and a VuCI management page.
